        <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_r_t_l_i_b_1a50a0bab21f1d14a86a1483ec283e4447" kindref="member">RTLIB::Libcall</ref> enum - This enum defines all of the runtime library calls the backend can emit. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The various long double types cannot be merged, because 80-bit library functions use &quot;xf&quot; and 128-bit use &quot;tf&quot;.</para>
<para>When adding PPCF128 functions here, note that their names generally need to be overridden for Darwin with the xxx$LDBL128 form. See <ref refid="_p_p_c_i_sel_lowering_8cpp" kindref="compound">PPCISelLowering.cpp</ref>. </para>
